<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main>
    <div class="twenty-hero">
        <img src="/images/2025/04/mums-group.jpg" alt="20 years BKFA">
    </div>

    <section class="twenty-years-section">
        <div class="twenty-years-container">

            <aside class="twenty-years-sidecard">
                <p>20 YEARS OF BKFA</p>
            </aside>

            <div class="twenty-years-content">
                <p class="twenty-years-label">20 YEARS OF BKFA</p>

                <h1>CELEBRATING 20 YEARS WITH MOTHER'S MAY</h1>

                <h2>Save the Date – Mother’s May 2026</h2>

                <p>
                    To celebrate 20 years of the Birthing Kit Foundation Australia, we will be holding a National Assembly Event over the month of May 2026.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We aim to pack 20,000 kits across the country during May to acknowledge our milestone of 20 years of the Foundation’s operation, while celebrating these key dates:
                </p>

                <ul class="twenty-years-list">
                    <li>International Day of the Midwife: Tuesday 5 May 2026</li>
                    <li>Mother’s Day: Sunday 10 May 2026</li>
                    <li>International Nurses Day: Tuesday 12 May 2026</li>
                </ul>

                <p>
                    If your club or organisation is looking to pack kits around this time, please consider holding your event during May and being part of this special event.
                </p>

                <div class="twenty-years-buttons">
                    <a href="/hostanassemblyday" class="twenty-btn">BOOK AN ASSEMBLY DAY EVENT</a>
                    <a href="/contact" class="twenty-btn">BOOK A KITS AT HOME EVENT</a>
                </div>

                <div class="twenty-years-public">
                    <h3>Public Events</h3>
                    <p>
                        A list of public Assembly Days will be added here as they are arranged. To volunteer at an event, please contact the Assembly Day Coordinator listed.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>